# The site's canonical absolute origin.
#
# Set this on the production deployment. Everything that has to point at a
# real host resolves from it: metadataBase (so og:image and the canonical
# link are absolute), robots.txt's Sitemap line, and sitemap.xml.
#
# Get it wrong and the link previews break — WhatsApp, LinkedIn and Slack
# fetch og:image from whatever host this names, and render a bare text link
# when that fetch fails.
#
# On Vercel this can be left unset: lib/siteUrl.ts falls back to
# VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL, then VERCEL_URL. Set it explicitly once a
# custom domain is attached.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://pradiptajana.com
